SUMMARY:White Christmas - AUDITIONS
DESCRIPTION:Audition Notice: \nWhite Christmas\nThe Brown County Playhouse will be producing White Christmas in December. \nDirector Dania Leova is excited to announce auditions for this beloved Christmas musical. \n  \nThe show will run: December 4\, 5\, 6\, 11\, 12\, 13\, 18\, 19 & 20 \nJoin us at The Brown County Playhouse for auditions for White Christmas! \n  \nWhen: August 25th and 26th\, 6:30-9 PM\n  \nWhat to bring: \nPlease bring a 32 bar cut of your favorite Christmas song\, and a 60 second prepared monologue. \n  \nAdditional: \nWe will be having callbacks for this show! Should we need you\, we will contact you to let you know. \n  \nCallbacks will be held on Thursday the 27th at 6:30 PM \nWe will also accept virtual auditions through Wednesday night. \n  \nIf you have any questions\, please feel free to call or text the director at (337) 396-4490. \n 
URL:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/event/white-christmas-auditions/2026-08-25/
LOCATION:Brown County Playhouse\, 70 S. Van Buren St\, Nashville\, IN\, 47448\, United States
CATEGORIES:Auditions,Featured Event,Live Shows,Music,Play,Theatre
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2026-WhiteChristmas_web_event.jpg
END:VEVENT
