SUMMARY:Rusty Bladen Tribute to Neil Young
DESCRIPTION:Rusty leads the band through a mix of Neil’s hits plus a number of his deeper cuts\, moving from “Harvest” era songs\, including Neil’s only #1 song\, “Heart of Gold”\, to the Young’s guitar rock and roll with songs like “Cinnamon Girl” and “Rockin’ in the Free World”. \n\n\n\n\nBUY TICKETS\n\n \nBUY TICKETS
