DESCRIPTION:🎸 Brown County Songwriter Showdown Returns! 🎶 And it’s packed with incredible talent! \nJoin us starting September 3\, 10\, 17\, and 24 at the Brown County Playhouse as local singer-songwriters take the stage to battle it out with original music\, Round 1 style. You get to be the judge\, so vote for your favorites and help decide who moves on to the next round! \n🎵 September 3 – John Whitcomb\, Tim Mattingly\, Matthew Marcelle\, Taylor Hernly\, Elkins Jamily\, Whiskey Hollow\n🎵 September 10 – Sharianne Whetstine\, Josh Gillespie\, Wade Griffin\, Tony Taylor\, Emmett Ransom\, Chris Wolf\n🎵 September 17 – Alexandra Edens Black\, Jon and Sarah Giddens\, Austin Beliles\, Brady Adams\, Brent Pierce\, Whiskey Graves\n🎵 September 24 – Robohippie\, Dakota Curtis\, Skinner\, Jake Cruser\, Debra Glaser\, Greg Lammers \nSupport local live music\, discover new voices\, and be part of the excitement! \nA huge thank you to our sponsors! Featured sponsor: Hills O’Brown Vacation Rentals. Supporting sponsors: Amplify Nashville\, Overlook Services\, and Rainwater Studios. And a shoutout to our radio partners\, Hoosier Country 105.1 FM WHCC and B97 WBWB! \n* Participants are subject to change without notice. \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nBUY TICKETS
